    \includegraphics[width=0.5\textwidth]{figs/real_exp02.png}
    \caption{Map update process: (a) Experimental demonstration of dynamic obstacle approach toward the robotic platform. (b) Real-time mapping results showing reconstructed obstacle planes from sensor data.}
