			Proposition \ref{pr:br_form}  yields a fundamental simplification in our problem as it implies that the supply functions in every Nash equilibrium $S^*$ of a $\nexp$-PAB auction game are necessarily in the form \eqref{eq:br_form} for every producer $i$ in $\mc N$. 
