		\begin{proposition}\label{prop:restr_game} 
			Consider a set of producers $\mathcal N$, production cost functions $C_i$ for every $i$ in $\mc N$, and  demand function $D$. 
			%		Consider the $K$-L PAB auction game, for some $K>0$, and the restricted % auction
