The obtained experimental results corroborate those observed in \Cref{subsec:case1_swiss_roll}. With the continuous streaming of samples, the algorithm demonstrated its adaptability by dynamically adjusting the number of clusters to better represent the complex manifold's structure, consequently leading to a decrease in the Mean Squared Error (MSE). 

