\centering
\caption{Average ($\pm$ 1-std) number of accumulated input \& output tokens, generation time per test data generation for the SQL code generation services. One can estimate the actual monetary cost using a (external) pricing model for \textit{gemini-2.0-flash}.}
\label{tab:cost_analysis}
\resizebox{\columnwidth}{!}{
\begin{tabular}{l c c c}
\toprule
 & Input tokens & Output tokens & Generation time (sec) \\
\midrule
SQL Code Assistant  & 162199.5 ($\pm$ 350852.1) & 3890 ($\pm$ 3121.5) & 66.0 ($\pm$ 53.6) \\
NL2SQL & 57082.3 ($\pm$ 102381.8) & 8054.2 ($\pm$ 13040.1) & 57.5 ($\pm$ 64.36) \\ 
\bottomrule
