We evaluate our model on the Kodak ($24$ images) \cite{kodak_dataset} and CLIC2020 ($41$ images) \cite{clic_2020} datasets. The mask ratio is selected from $[0.1, 0.9]$. %for the Kodak dataset and from $[0.15, 0.35]$ for the CLIC2020 dataset. 
