LotteryCodec is compared with classical codecs (VTM-19.1 \cite{bross2021developments}, HEVC \cite{sullivan2012overview}), AE-based neural codecs (CST \cite{cheng2020learned}, EVC \cite{wang2023evc}, MLIC+ \cite{jiang2023mlic}), and other overfitted image codecs (including C3 \cite{kim2024c3} and COOL-CHIC \cite{leguay2023low}). The peak signal-to-noise ratio (PSNR) on RGB channels and BD-rate \cite{gisle2001calculation} are used to evaluate the RD performance. The evaluation details and additional experiments, including the ablation study and visualizations, are presented in the appendix \ref{ap_vis}.

