LITE and LINE are slower, but still run 100 times faster than DEHB. Hence we say:
\begin{conclusion}{ RQ3) Is  {\sffamily BINGO}-based reasoning fast?}
 Yes. RANDOM is the fastest but, given the Figure~\ref{pcf} results, when dealing with less than 50 labels, we recommend LINE or LITE. 
