\begin{itemize}
\item Methods of type A of the form \eqref{eq_IMEX_1}--\eqref{eq_IMEX_3} show a poor accuracy. Although the numerical convergence rate is close to 2 (and not to 1 as we expected basing on \cite{Boscarino2007}), the absolute value of the solution error is big. This motivates to use a different IMEX formulation for this method, see Section~\ref{sect:IMEXv2}.
