    \item \textbf{RQ2:} Can \textsc{Tech-ASan} reduce the runtime overhead of ASan?
    % (\S\ref{sec:Runtime overhead})
    \item \textbf{RQ3:} How does \textsc{Tech-ASan} impact compilation time and binary size compared to ASan? 
    % (\S\ref{sec:Binary Size}) 
