  For all $C,\sigma,p,\tau,q,l$ such that $\bigstep{C}{\sigma}{p}{l}{\tau}{q}$, for all $x,y,v$, if $y\notin\Fv(C)$, then $\bigstep{C[y/x]}{\sigma[x\mapsto v][y\mapsto\eval{x}{\sigma}]}{p}{l}{\tau[x\mapsto v][y\mapsto\eval{x}{\tau}]}{q}$.
