Structure & 3D Coordinates & ECFP & MACC & Gromov-Hausdorff Ultrametric \\ \hline
Cubic  & 0.209  & 0.483  & 0.960 & \textbf{1.000}  \\ \hline
Orthorhombic & 0.009  & 0.030  & \textbf{1.000} & \textbf{1.000}  \\ \hline
Tetragonal  &  0.436  & 0.322  & 0.827 & \textbf{0.980}  \\ \hline
\end{tabular}
