We propose a 2-step methodology responsible for trajectories detection and statistical data extraction/analysis. The first part aims to obtain the individual trajectories of observed pedestrians in real videos using machine learning algorithms. We performed the Fundamental diagram experiment in Brazil, as illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig_config_exp}.

